      "reason": "Action not within grant scope. External confirmation required."
    }
  },
  "authority_basis": "grant",
  "notes": "Report draft strictly follows Agent A's decisions: uses only source Z figures, excludes source X entirely, notes Helios contribution not separately identified in source Z, and keeps question Q open. All actions outside grant scope are deferred to external confirmation."
}

